**Learn English with Your Mother**

Learn English naturally through real TV conversations.

Learn English with Your Mother is an interactive language learning app inspired by the conversational style of the popular sitcom *How I Met Your Mother*. Instead of memorizing isolated words, you learn English from authentic dialogues, understand grammar in context, and improve your listening skills through interactive exercises.

This is a fan-made educational project created for English learners.

Features

• Interactive video-based lessons
• Read every subtitle line by line
• Multiple subtitle display modes
• Grammar chunk explanations
• Natural AI-powered translations
• Listening practice with real conversations
• Draw and write notes directly on transcripts
• Resume exactly where you left off
• Automatic progress saving
• Fast and simple interface

Supported Languages

• English
• Turkish
• Spanish
• Portuguese
• Simplified Chinese
• Hindi
• Vietnamese
• Indonesian
• Thai

AI-Powered Learning

Instead of relying on traditional machine translation, the app uses modern AI models to produce more natural, context-aware translations. This helps learners better understand:

• Everyday conversations
• Idioms
• Humor
• Expressions
• Spoken English

Your Progress Is Saved

The app automatically remembers:

• Last watched lesson
• Playback position
• Personal transcript notes

You can continue learning anytime without losing your progress.

